before:
Complete local Java example; the app itself does not execute it:
```java
class Session {
    int minutes;
    Session(int minutes) { this.minutes = minutes; }
}
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Session session = new Session(12);
        System.out.println(session.minutes);
    }
}

```

